# WorkSlop Desktop line-ending rules.
# The frozen-file guard (tools/test_icon_themes_frozen.py) pins SHA-256
# of source files; a CRLF checkout on Windows changed the bytes and
# failed the guard in CI (2026-10-09). Text sources are LF everywhere.
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.qm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
